 "observedBefore": [
  "flame1_hell (q3map_surfacelight 600), flame2 and flame1side blend additively: raster draws and animates them; they are not in the acceleration structures",
  "the light built from an animated emitter was its shader's average, constant in time",
  "the stage snapshot kept 8 animMap frames; longer animMaps cycled 8 frames in the trace",
  "animMapPhase, animMapOnce, oneShotAnimMap, frameFromEntity and RF_SETANIMINDEX were not passed to the trace",
  "an additive emitter without q3map_surfacelight took the fullbright-lit bright-texel rule",
  "a colour wave's mean left out tr.identityLight"
 ],
 "changes": [
  "animated emitters: a light's colour is scaled each frame by its shader's fold at the frame's shader time over the fold's mean over time (480 samples 0.0731 s apart); surface lights fold with the lighting term white, glowing shaders black; scale clamped to [0, 8]; steady below 0.5% deviation",
  "rtx_rt_animated_lights (default 1; 0 keeps every light at its mean), in the settings that restart the denoiser's history",
  "stage snapshot keeps up to MAX_IMAGE_ANIMATIONS (64) frames, the phase, hold and frame-from-entity bits",
  "GPU stage: frame count in state.z bits 22..27, hold bit 20, frame-from-entity bit 21; frames past 8 and the phase in records after the material's stages (tc1.w names the first)",
  "entity frame in a dynamic vertex's normal.w beside the no-shadow sign (RT_EntityFrameLane)",
  "additive first stage no longer fullbright-lit; colour wave values and means at tr.identityLight"
 ],
